{"id":"n24645-2-6","stage":3,"title":"좌우 · 左右","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24645-2-6-1","ko":"너는 왜 그렇게 좌우를 두리번거려?","zh":"你为什么一直左右张望呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좌우를","meaning":"左右","explanation":"좌우：左右；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"좌우","audio":"/audio/57e8ffbc71211ae1e6da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24645","senseId":"2","lemma":"좌우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두리번거려?","meaning":"东张西望，左顾右盼","explanation":"두리번거리다：东张西望，左顾右盼；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"두리번거리다","audio":"/audio/d7e5f45f1dfcce33b567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14971","senseId":"1","lemma":"두리번거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"57e8ffbc71211ae1","term":"좌우","zh":"左右","audio":"/audio/57e8ffbc71211ae1e6da.mp3","entryId":"24645","definition":"旁边或周围。","pronunciation":["좌ː우"]},{"id":"d7e5f45f1dfcce33","term":"두리번거리다","zh":"东张西望，左顾右盼","audio":"/audio/d7e5f45f1dfcce33b567.mp3","entryId":"14971","definition":"睁大眼睛总是到处观察。","pronunciation":["두리번거리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bfe50aa9669918354ea3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24645-2-6-2","ko":"사실 누구를 기다리고 있는데 영 안 오네.","zh":"其实我在等某个人，可他怎么还没来啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사실","meaning":"事实上，其实","explanation":"사실：事实上，其实","readings":[{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71275","senseId":"2","lemma":"사실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구를","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리고","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영","meaning":"压根儿","explanation":"영：压根儿","readings":[{"term":"영","audio":"/audio/ed8d7800a0b7901bb02a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14123","senseId":"1","lemma":"영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오네.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c087c91deb495f97","term":"사실","zh":"事实上，其实","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3","entryId":"71275","definition":"用于直率地说出表面上看不出的事实。","pronunciation":["사ː실"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ed8d7800a0b7901b","term":"영","zh":"压根儿","audio":"/audio/ed8d7800a0b7901bb02a.mp3","entryId":"14123","definition":"根本或一点也。","pronunciation":["영"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/30383cd7cdde93db0001.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24645","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["其实我在等某个人，可他怎么还没来啊。","你为什么一直左右张望呢？","你刚才没感觉到大楼在震动吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你为什么一直左右张望呢？","你刚才没感觉到大楼在震动吗？","其实我在等某个人，可他怎么还没来啊。"],"answer":2}]}
